{"id":"n40387-1-9","stage":3,"title":"느긋하다 · 轻松","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n40387-1-9-1","ko":"내일은 일요일이니까 모처럼 늦잠도 자고 영화도 보면서 느긋하게 휴일을 보내요.","zh":"明天是周日，难得可以多睡会儿懒觉，再看看电影，悠闲地度过假期。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"내일은","meaning":"明天，明日","explanation":"내일：明天，明日；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"내일","audio":"/audio/1e07b94ba5182a41e7de.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30193","senseId":"1","lemma":"내일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내일은","audio":"/audio/a7181639ea1108daa648.mp3"}},{"text":"일요일이니까","meaning":"星期日， 星期天，周日，礼拜天","explanation":"일요일：星期日， 星期天，周日，礼拜天；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；니까：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"일요일","audio":"/audio/1094b7d96a9a4109f162.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30198","senseId":"1","lemma":"일요일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"일요일이니까","audio":"/audio/e167953c556d7ecaed9e.mp3"}},{"text":"모처럼","meaning":"特意，难得，好容易","explanation":"모처럼：特意，难得，好容易。","readings":[{"term":"모처럼","audio":"/audio/c5e9364a3b55a5020afc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16147","senseId":"1","lemma":"모처럼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"모처럼","audio":"/audio/c5e9364a3b55a5020afc.mp3"}},{"text":"늦잠도","meaning":"懒觉","explanation":"늦잠：懒觉；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"늦잠","audio":"/audio/4dc69297f0f60b6cd02e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"41393","senseId":"1","lemma":"늦잠","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"늦잠도","audio":"/audio/479dd03f76c830b0a64c.mp3"}},{"text":"자고","meaning":"睡，睡觉","explanation":"자다：睡，睡觉；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"자다","audio":"/audio/023aa5fb341789792a99.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69511","senseId":"1","lemma":"자다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"자고","audio":"/audio/5755a7902444d09e923d.mp3"}},{"text":"영화도","meaning":"电影","explanation":"영화：电影；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"영화","audio":"/audio/1f0a9d32bbf42b6d556f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71624","senseId":"1","lemma":"영화","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"영화도","audio":"/audio/849d2473f8d90d97fcf5.mp3"}},{"text":"보면서","meaning":"看，观看，观赏","explanation":"보다：看，观看，观赏；면서：表示同时进行或并列；与 도 合用可表示“同时却、尽管”。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"2","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보면서","audio":"/audio/aa1ba2c9e8350885e0f3.mp3"}},{"text":"느긋하게","meaning":"轻松，悠闲","explanation":"느긋하다：轻松，悠闲；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"느긋하다","audio":"/audio/b8a37bf7c2eab961e9ca.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"40387","senseId":"1","lemma":"느긋하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"느긋하게","audio":"/audio/fc5d0edb73d99dfbd10b.mp3"}},{"text":"휴일을","meaning":"休息日，公休日，假日","explanation":"휴일：休息日，公休日，假日；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"휴일","audio":"/audio/98c4721ccd1350f17224.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73252","senseId":"1","lemma":"휴일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"휴일을","audio":"/audio/4affd6367cfb0cfc265c.mp3"}},{"text":"보내요.","meaning":"度过","explanation":"보내다：度过；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"보내다","audio":"/audio/8af300ffd85ed5a13777.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66375","senseId":"7","lemma":"보내다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보내요","audio":"/audio/0ba6af28ecc23da016d4.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1e07b94ba5182a41","term":"내일","zh":"明天，明日","audio":"/audio/1e07b94ba5182a41e7de.mp3","entryId":"30193","definition":"今天的下一天。","pronunciation":["내일"]},{"id":"1094b7d96a9a4109","term":"일요일","zh":"星期日， 星期天，周日，礼拜天","audio":"/audio/1094b7d96a9a4109f162.mp3","entryId":"30198","definition":"以星期一为基准，指一个星期中的最后一天。","pronunciation":["이료일"]},{"id":"c5e9364a3b55a502","term":"모처럼","zh":"特意，难得，好容易","audio":"/audio/c5e9364a3b55a5020afc.mp3","entryId":"16147","definition":"打算很久后才第一次实现，好不容易。","pronunciation":["모처럼"]},{"id":"4dc69297f0f60b6c","term":"늦잠","zh":"懒觉","audio":"/audio/4dc69297f0f60b6cd02e.mp3","entryId":"41393","definition":"早上睡到很晚的觉。","pronunciation":["늗짬"]},{"id":"023aa5fb34178979","term":"자다","zh":"睡，睡觉","audio":"/audio/023aa5fb341789792a99.mp3","entryId":"69511","definition":"闭眼睛，停止身体、精神活动，一时进入休息状态。","pronunciation":["자다"]},{"id":"1f0a9d32bbf42b6d","term":"영화","zh":"电影","audio":"/audio/1f0a9d32bbf42b6d556f.mp3","entryId":"71624","definition":"含有一定的意义，拍摄移动的对象，用放映机投影到银幕上看的综合性艺术。","pronunciation":["영화"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看，观看，观赏","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"用眼睛享受或欣赏某个对象。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"b8a37bf7c2eab961","term":"느긋하다","zh":"轻松，悠闲","audio":"/audio/b8a37bf7c2eab961e9ca.mp3","entryId":"40387","definition":"不急不躁，内心从容。","pronunciation":["느그타다"]},{"id":"98c4721ccd1350f1","term":"휴일","zh":"休息日，公休日，假日","audio":"/audio/98c4721ccd1350f17224.mp3","entryId":"73252","definition":"如周日或法定假日等不工作、休息的日子。","pronunciation":["휴일"]},{"id":"8af300ffd85ed5a1","term":"보내다","zh":"度过","audio":"/audio/8af300ffd85ed5a13777.mp3","entryId":"66375","definition":"让时间流逝。","pronunciation":["보내다"]}],"audio":"/audio/734a2616416fd13e908b.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n40387-1-9-2","ko":"좋은 생각이에요!","zh":"好主意！","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"좋은","meaning":"好的","explanation":"좋다：好、令人满意；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"1","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좋은","audio":"/audio/dc3caaaf06a600dc6306.mp3"}},{"text":"생각이에요!","meaning":"念头，想法","explanation":"생각：念头，想法；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；에요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"생각","audio":"/audio/6ac12a8f8e4e4c22657b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58162","senseId":"3","lemma":"생각","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"생각이에요","audio":"/audio/aecfb179c49c144ea2e9.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"好、令人满意","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"好、令人满意","pronunciation":["조ː타"]},{"id":"6ac12a8f8e4e4c22","term":"생각","zh":"念头，想法","audio":"/audio/6ac12a8f8e4e4c22657b.mp3","entryId":"58162","definition":"想做某事的心理或关注；或指那样的事。","pronunciation":["생각"]}],"audio":"/audio/62003072778fbd9fe65b.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.205,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=40387","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":113,"sequenceScore":2.9303,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["好主意！","这里纸上写的是什么呀？","明天是周日，难得可以多睡会儿懒觉，再看看电影，悠闲地度过假期。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["好主意！","明天是周日，难得可以多睡会儿懒觉，再看看电影，悠闲地度过假期。","这里纸上写的是什么呀？"],"answer":0}]}
